From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oxp3-fixes <oxp3-fixes@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] steamcompmgr: hold the refresh rate while the Steam UI is focused

Port of upstream ValveSoftware/gamescope 8e0a5bee (Matthew Schwartz) onto
0001 + 0002, which skipped it. While the Steam UI is focused with adaptive
sync, present on every vblank timer wakeup, so an idle Steam UI no longer
lets the output stretch toward its VRR floor and snap back on the next
update. Games keep the full VRR range; adaptive_sync_idle_hold=0 turns the
hold off.

On the OneXPlayer 3 with a JSAUX dock (Synaptics VMM7100 DP-to-HDMI PCON)
and an LG TV, a per-vblank recording showed the idle Steam UI stretching
frames to the 40 Hz floor (25 ms) before the TV picture broke and the dock
reset. Replaces the local workarounds 0003 (external VRR startup), 0004
(LG SDR metadata) and 0005 (LG idle repeat).

Only the hold is ported: upstream's reuse of the last composite for an
unchanged frame (a power optimisation) is left out, so an idle Steam UI
recomposites each vblank.

---
 src/steamcompmgr.cpp | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/steamcompmgr.cpp b/src/steamcompmgr.cpp
index 6823bf5..b3d4bbb 100644
--- a/src/steamcompmgr.cpp
+++ b/src/steamcompmgr.cpp
@@ -344,6 +344,7 @@ gamescope::ConVar<bool> cv_adaptive_sync_ignore_overlay( "adaptive_sync_ignore_o
 gamescope::ConVar<int> cv_adaptive_sync_overlay_cycles( "adaptive_sync_overlay_cycles", 1, "Number of vblank cycles to ignore overlay repaints before forcing a commit with adaptive sync." );
 gamescope::ConVar<bool> cv_adaptive_sync_uncapped( "adaptive_sync_uncapped", true, "Whether or not to allow mailbox/immediate clients to run uncapped with adaptive sync by deferring paints until the display can take a new flip." );
 gamescope::ConVar<int> cv_adaptive_sync_cursor_min_fps( "adaptive_sync_cursor_min_fps", 30, "Content frame rate at or above which cursor repaints coalesce with content frames when adaptive sync is on. 0 = repaint the cursor immediately." );
+gamescope::ConVar<bool> cv_adaptive_sync_idle_hold( "adaptive_sync_idle_hold", true, "Hold the display at its refresh rate while the Steam UI is focused with adaptive sync." );
 
 gamescope::ConVar<bool> cv_upscale_preemptive( "upscale_preemptive", true, "Allow pre-emptive upscaling" );
 gamescope::ConVar<bool> cv_upscale_preemptive_debug_force_sync( "upscale_preemptive_debug_force_sync", false, "Force synchronize pre-emptive upscaling" );
@@ -9782,6 +9783,13 @@ steamcompmgr_main(int argc, char **argv)
 							}
 						}
 
+						// Hold the Steam UI at the refresh rate so an idle display can't stretch toward its minimum.
+						if ( !bShouldPaint && bIsVBlankFromTimer && g_bSteamIsActiveWindow &&
+						     cv_adaptive_sync_idle_hold )
+						{
+							bShouldPaint = true;
+						}
+
 						if ( bIsVBlankFromTimer )
 						{
 							if ( hasRepaintNonBasePlane )
